ng> Boost hero stats like attack, defense, and health\u2014crucial for tough encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consumable Items:</strong> Provide temporary boosts or debuffs, often turning the tide of battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Depth:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap heroes mid-battle to counter threats or adapt to environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master buffs, debuffs, and stuns to control the flow of combat.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CORE MECHANICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras/160209076b24c3896ecae5bc13e0a5fa.avif?t=1755411791\" data-has-big width=800 height=481 /></span><br>Travel through 60 unique worlds using the Chrono-Porter. Each world features distinct environments, enemies, quests, puzzles, and hidden treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3 vs 3 Turn-Based Combat:</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829720/extras/25d957accc570ac1f9caad7278e3fe92.avif?t=1755411791\" data-has-big width=800 height=511 /></span>Battle in teams of three heroes. Speed determines turn order. Choose to attack, defend, or swap\u2014every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero Customization &amp; Progression:</strong><br>Heroes gain XP from missions and combat. Unlock abilities via skill trees and evolve your team\u2019s strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Management:</strong><br>Collect and manage coins and gems wisely. Use them to upgrade heroes, unlock items, and progress through increasingly difficult challenges.</p>",
